# <gitmoji> <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Examples:
#   ✨ feat(study): add CSV export for thermal sessions
#   🐛 fix(parser): handle missing GPU hotspot sensor
#   📝 docs(readme): add LibreHardwareMonitor download steps
#
# Common gitmojis: ✨ feat · 🐛 fix · 📝 docs · ♻️ refactor · ⚡️ perf
#   ✅ test · 🎨 style · 🔧 config · 👷 ci · ⬆️ deps · 🔖 release
#   🚑️ hotfix · 🔥 remove · 🙈 gitignore · 📄 license · 🔀 merge
# Full list: https://gitmoji.dev
#
# Body: explain WHAT and WHY (wrap at 72 chars).
# Footer: "Closes #123", "BREAKING CHANGE: ..."
